  <reporting-org ref="XM-DAC-7" type="10">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ministry of Foreign Affairs of the Netherlands</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NL Employers 4 SDG8 Programme Energising Businesses and Business Ecosystems Period 2023-2030 Merged PUM-DECP Organisation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The new proposition by the merger of DECP and PUM is called Vibrant Business Systems. It entails an approach to improve relevant aspects of the business environment in which (M)SMEs operate. It is spearheaded by empowered (E)BMOs and delivered in collaboration with a range of PSD partners. PUM aims to coordinate and provide support to (M)SMEs in coherent clusters and value chains. PUM delivers expertise to BSOs, VETs and business incubators. &quot;Through these pathways, the entire business systems will progress to a higher level of functioning. This is not only beneficial for employers and employees, but also contributes to better socio-economic circumstances for society as a whole&quot;...</narrative>
  </description>
